{"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"removePack:withCompletionHandler:"}],"externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNOfflineStorage(im)removePack:withCompletionHandler:","title":"removePack:withCompletionHandler:","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"removePack:withCompletionHandler:","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"- ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"removePack:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)MLNOfflinePack","text":"MLNOfflinePack","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePack"},{"kind":"text","text":" *) "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"pack"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"withCompletionHandler:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:MLNOfflineStorage.h@T@MLNOfflinePackRemovalCompletionHandler","text":"MLNOfflinePackRemovalCompletionHandler","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePackRemovalCompletionHandler"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"completion"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"pack","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The offline pack to remove."}]}]},{"name":"completion","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The completion handler to call once the pack has been"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"removed. This handler is executed asynchronously on the main queue."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"As soon as this method is called on a pack, the pack becomes invalid; any","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"attempt to send it a message will result in an exception being thrown. If an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"error occurs and the pack cannot be removed, do not attempt to reuse the pack","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"object. Instead, if you need continued access to the pack, suspend all packs","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and use the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflineStorage\/reloadPacks","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" method to obtain valid pointers to all the packs.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"To detect when any call to this method results in a pack being removed, observe","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"KVO change notifications on the shared offline storage object’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"packs"},{"text":" key","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"path. Removals from that array result in an ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSKeyValueChangeRemoval"},{"text":" change.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When you remove an offline pack, any resources that are required by that pack,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"but not other packs, become eligible for deletion from offline storage. Because"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the backing store used for offline storage is also used as a general purpose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cache for map resources, such resources may not be immediately removed if the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"implementation determines that they remain useful for general performance of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the map.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflineStorage"]]},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Unregisters the given offline pack and allows resources that are no longer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"required by any remaining packs to be potentially freed."}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnofflinestorage\/removepack:withcompletionhandler:"]}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflineStorage\/removePack:withCompletionHandler:"},"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNOfflineStorage":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnofflinestorage","abstract":[{"text":"MLNOfflineStorage implements a singleton (shared object) that manages offline","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"packs and ambient caching. All of this class’s instance methods are asynchronous,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reflecting the fact that offline resources are stored in a database. The shared","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"object maintains a canonical collection of offline packs in its ","type":"text"},{"code":"packs","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" property.","type":"text"}],"title":"MLNOfflineStorage","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"MLNOfflineStorage","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflineStorage"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNOfflinePack":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnofflinepack","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePack","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" represents a collection of resources necessary for viewing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a region offline to a local database."}],"title":"MLNOfflinePack","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"MLNOfflinePack","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePack"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNOfflineStorage/removePack:withCompletionHandler:":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"removePack:withCompletionHandler:","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnofflinestorage\/removepack:withcompletionhandler:","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Unregisters the given offline pack and allows resources that are no longer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"required by any remaining packs to be potentially freed."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"removePack:withCompletionHandler:"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflineStorage\/removePack:withCompletionHandler:","role":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"title":"MapLibre","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre","role":"collection","abstract":[{"text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNOfflinePackRemovalCompletionHandler":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnofflinepackremovalcompletionhandler","title":"MLNOfflinePackRemovalCompletionHandler","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePackRemovalCompletionHandler","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A block to be called once an offline pack has been completely invalidated and"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"removed.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"MLNOfflinePackRemovalCompletionHandler","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNOfflineStorage/reloadPacks":{"title":"reloadPacks","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"reloadPacks"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnofflinestorage\/reloadpacks","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Forcibly, asynchronously reloads the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"packs"},{"text":" property. At some point after this","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"method is called, the pointer values of the ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePack"},{"text":" objects in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"packs"},{"text":" property change, even if the underlying data for these packs has not","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"changed. If this method is called while a pack is actively downloading, the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"behavior is undefined.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflineStorage\/reloadPacks"}}}